      "name": "_infer_provider",
      "line_number": 391,
      "docstring": "Infer provider from model string.\n\nHeuristics (deterministic):\n\n    \u2022 If \"claude\" in model \u2192 \"anthropic\"\n    \u2022 If \"gemini\" or \"google\" in model \u2192 \"google\"\n    \u2022 Else \u2192 \"openai\"",
